OL,3,GNEWSALancashire stone helps boost
OL,4,Afamous Barcelona basilica
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the most famous religious
OL,7,Fbuildings in the world now has a unique
OL,8,Fconnection to Lancashire, it has
OL,9,Femerged.
OL,11,FStone from Brinscall Quarry in Chorley
OL,12,Fhas been used to help get Barcelona's
OL,13,Flandmark Sagrada Familia building up to
OL,14,Fits final height.
OL,16,FThe sandstone mined there was found to
OL,17,Fbe the right match for the stone being
OL,18,Fused for the 144-year-old basilica,
OL,19,Fwhich has famously remained under
OL,20,Fconstruction ever since its first stone
OL,21,Fwas laid in 1882.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
