OL,3,GNEWSALancashire stone helps boost
OL,4,Afamous Barcelona basilica
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Armstrong, owner of Armstrong's
OL,7,FAggregates, which runs the quarry,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's such a great honour to be
OL,9,Fpart of it."
